# RUN: %pyxc -v < %s 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CHECK
# CHECK-DAG: {{Parsed a function definition}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fmul double}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fmul double}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fmul double}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fmul double}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fadd double}}
# CHECK-DAG: {{fadd double}}
# CHECK-NOT: {{fmul double}}
# CHECK-NOT: {{fadd double}}

# FunctionDefinitionNode::codegen: each subexpression produces a separate SSA value.
# For (a+b)^2 = a*a + 2*a*b + b*b there are exactly 4 fmul and 2 fadd
# instructions (a*a, 2*a, (2*a)*b, b*b = 4 fmul; two additions = 2 fadd).
# The JIT takes ownership of the module, so I print this IR only once.
def foo(a, b):
a * a + 2 * a * b + b * b
